### Trimble Agriculture (NAV 900, GFX-750, GFX-1260)

- Compatibility: Full, but requires correct setup
- Setup: Select "Internet RTK" or "Single Base RTCM" as correction source, NOT "VRS" or "Network RTK"
- Warning: Trimble ag displays default to VRS mode. RTKdata is NOT a VRS network. See the Trimble Receivers page for detailed instructions.
...
### John Deere StarFire

- Compatibility: Works through an external NTRIP modem. StarFire receivers have no built-in NTRIP client, so they cannot dial a caster on their own.
- Models: StarFire SF6000, SF7000 and SF7500 with an active Mobile RTK (mRTK) license. The SF1 and SF2 accuracy levels do not support RTK at all.
- How it works: An external NTRIP modem (such as CloudBase RTK) pulls the RTCM3 stream from RTKdata and feeds it to the receiver. See the John Deere StarFire setup guide for the full configuration.
- Alternative: Aftermarket guidance systems such as FieldBee or FJ Dynamics replace the Deere receiver entirely and take NTRIP directly.

