### Estimated 64 billion Pix transactions in 2024, 53% higher YOY

Pix transactions over 80% more than credit and debit combined Launched just 4 years ago, Pix has quickly become the most widely used payment system in Brazil. In Q3 2024, the number of Pix transactions was 80% more than credit and debit combined. Even compared with ACH volume in the U.S., a payment rail that has been around for 50 years in a country with roughly double the Brazilian population, Pix continues to impress. ACH volume in 2024 is estimated at 34 billion or just over half the 2024 Pix transactions.

In December 2024 alone, the number of Pix transactions is estimated to be 6.4 billion, 34% more than in December 2023.
