 Data management for certifications and compliance (SIC) 

The Internal Control System enables the registration of producers and plots with precise geolocation and the completion of digital forms for organic certification, as well as certifications such as Fairtrade and Rainforest Alliance.

 Compliance with EUDR regulation 

Sirio integrates the registration of plot boundaries and coordinates to facilitate deforestation-free verification in accordance with the European Union Deforestation Regulation (EUDR).
