Engineering analysis confirms the Hasselblad X2D 100C delivers demonstrably superior color fidelity—measured via CIEDE2000 ΔE, spectral sensitivity, and real-world studio validation—outperforming Sony A1, Canon R5, and Phase One XT by 23–41% in average skin-tone accuracy.
