Studio, the top consumer-facing tier, adds tools built for high-volume, client-facing production:

- Client Viewers for sharing work with customers directly
- An expanded AI Crop tool
- The ability to compare up to 11 image variants side by side
- Offline collaboration for teams working without a constant connection
- Multiple viewer screens
- Automated backup
- Tool locks to prevent accidental setting changes during a shoot

Several of these Studio-exclusive tools, including Client Viewers and advanced AI Crop, were previously reserved for Enterprise customers only, so their move into a purchasable tier is a genuine expansion of what a working photographer can access without an enterprise contract.
