- Hasselblad X2D 100C 

- Hasselblad X2D II 100C 

- Hasselblad CFV 100C 

This means you can import, view, edit, and export RAW files from these cameras. For the complete and regularly updated list of supported models, see Camera Models and RAW Files Supported by Capture One.

