• have applied for admission to a French institution prior to applying for the scholarship. For admission procedure, please contact your nearest Campus France office in India or refer to the website of the institution of your choice.

An applicant is not eligible, if he/she - • is a PhD student or intends to complete his/her master’s thesis, training program, or research project in France.

• has previously been awarded the Charpak Master scholarship.

