concepts and maintain that the originally hypothesized real memristor device is missing and likely 
impossible. The argument is illustrated also by finding an ideal mechanical memristor element and 
purely mechanical memristive systems, and hypothesizing a real mechanical memristor device that 
requires inert mass just like the 1971 implied device requires magnetic induction.
