AJLP&GS, e-ISSN: 2657-2664, Vol.9 Issue 7 https://doi.org/10.48346/IMIST.PRSM/ajlp-gs.v9i7.62428

control  of  households  (Adato  and  Meinzen-Dick,  2002).  Access  and  use  of  assets  is  influenced  by
policies, institutions and relationships between individuals and is mediated by strategies adopted to
produce outcomes. The SLF emphasises the role of institutions, organisations and policies in shaping
access to resources and livelihood opportunities (Scoones, 2015).

