The*Amazon Web Services General Reference*lists the HealthOmics service endpoints for each region. SeeService quotas and endpoints for HealthOmics. For each region, HealthOmics provides separate API endpoints for storage API operations, analytics API operations, and workflow API operations.
The endpoints take the following format:
```
`storage-omics.`region`.amazonaws.com
analytics-omics.`region`.amazonaws.com
workflows-omics.`region`.amazonaws.com
Examples: storage-omics.us-east-1.amazonaws.com
analytics-omics.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com
workflows-omics.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com`
```

