# Microsoft joins AWS, Google in waiving cloud egress fees

 Contrary to analyst expectations, Microsoft and Amazon Web Services have followed Google Cloud in eliminating some data egress fees. 

March 14, 2024
...
In a move analysts didn't see coming, peer pressure from Amazon Web Services (AWS) and Google Cloud seems to have paid off – Microsoft today shared it’s following its rivals’ footsteps and eliminating fees associated with transferring data out of the Microsoft Azure cloud to the internet.

